{x}^{-2} \\\\  & =12{x}^{3}-18{x}^{2}-{x}^{-2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we evaluate at $x=2$ and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(2) & =12(2{)}^{3}-18(2{)}^{2}-(2{)}^{-2} \\\\  & =96-72-\\frac{1}{4} \\\\  & =\\frac{95}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the slope of the tangent to the curve is $\\frac{95}{4}.$" 13194139533640 true] [17592186243484 1000 #edb/ref 17592186243485 13194139533640 true] [17592186243484 1000 #edb/ref 17592186243486 13194139533640 true] [17592186243484 1000 #edb/ref 17592186243487 13194139533640 true] [17592186243484 1000 #edb/ref 17592186243488 13194139533640 true] [17592186243484 1000 #edb/ref 17592186243489 13194139533640 true] [17592186243484 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533640 true] [17592186243484 1041 "selection" 13194139533640 true] [17592186243484 1104 #edb/ref 17592186243485 13194139533640 true] [17592186243484 1110 #uuid "99768217-d593-5fca-9b10-c4146ae4d86c" 13194139533640 true] [17592186243485 1034 "\\frac{95}{4}" 13194139533640 true] [17592186243485 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533640 true] [17592186243485 1111 #uuid "0e5be78f-8dfd-5de7-b5f7-8be44c275cd0" 13194139533640 true] [17592186243486 1034 "\\frac{95}{2}" 13194139533640 true] [17592186243486 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533640 true] [17592186243486 1111 #uuid "e41a64db-612b-5a0e-93dc-cd2ba7bb302d" 13194139533640 true] [17592186243487 1034 "\\frac{93}{4}" 13194139533640 true] [17592186243487 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533640 true] [17592186243487 1111 #uuid "31a6f2b0-f613-5ffe-8264-0e32fd132e19" 13194139533640 true] [17592186243488 1034 "\\frac{95}{3}" 13194139533640 true] [17592186243488 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533640 true] [17592186243488 1111 #uuid "5da22d19-a503-5c3f-a01b-c5b838d3c356" 13194139533640 true] [17592186243489 1034 "\\frac{97}{4}" 13194139533640 true] [17592186243489 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533640 true] [17592186243489 1111 #uuid "540f11ea-c36a-5a0b-bace-4711cb36480a" 13194139533640 true] [17592186243490 1017 #edb/ref 17592186243491 13194139533640 true] [17592186243490 1089 "q-1901" 13194139533640 true] [17592186243490 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139533640 true] [17592186243490 1100 "What is the slope of the tangent to the curve $y=5{x}^{4}+\\sqrt[3]{{x}^{2}}$ at the point $(1,6)?$" 13194139533640 true] [17592186243490 1113 #uuid "c57c9928-5e43-54b8-b676-a2f59a2207b1" 13194139533640 true] [17592186243490 1138 false 13194139533640 true] [17592186243490 1145 "This time, we'll use $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ notation. First, we compute the derivative, which gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(5{x}^{4}+\\sqrt[3]{{x}^{2}}) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(5{x}^{4}+{x}^{2/3}) \\\\  & =4\\cdot 5{x}^{3}+\\frac{2}{3}\\cdot {x}^{-1/3} \\\\  & =20{x}^{3}+\\frac{2{x}^{-1/3}}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEvaluating at $x=1$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{x=1} & =20(1{)}^{3}+\\frac{2(1{)}^{-1/3}}{3} \\\\  & =20+\\frac{2}{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{62}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the slope of the tangent to the curve is $\\frac{62}{3}.$" 13194139533640 true] [17592186243491 1000 #edb/ref 17592186243492 13194139533640 true] [17592186243491 1000 #edb/ref 17592186243493 13194139533640 true] [17592186243491 1000 #edb/ref 17592186243494 13194139533640 true] [17592186243491 1000 #edb/ref 17592186243495 13194139533640 true] [17592186243491 1000 #edb/ref 17592186243496 13194139533640 true] [17592186243491 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533640 true] [17592186243491 1041 "selection" 13194139533640 true] [17592186243491 1104 #edb/ref 17592186243496 13194139533640 true] [17592186243491 1110 #uuid "c62a35e7-6f9d-5b23-8112-746840662d13" 13194139533640 true] [17592186243492 1034 "\\frac{20}{3}" 13194139533640 true] [17592186243492 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533640 true] [17592186243492 1111 #uuid "7418489d-97ad-5339-9a74-966cc9d2372a" 13194139533640 true] [175921862